This needs to be clarified:

There is nothing in the game called "cancellation resistance."  It
wouldn't be needed anyway, since no monster has a cancellation ability
and they don't use the wand.  What it offers is "magical cancellation",
which is a property similar in concept to magic resistance but
affecting different things.

The biggest thing it helps with is level drain; with level 2 magic
cancellation it still works sometimes, with level 3 you'll only get
level-drained once in a blue moon.

